   "offered_by": {
    "allegiance": "codex/death_guard/allegiances/allegiance_death_guard"
   },
   "text": "Requirements\n\n- If your army contains Typhus, he must be your Warlord.\n- Your army must include at least 3 units of Pox Walkers.\n- Your army may not include Mortarion, Daemon Primarch of the Death Guard.\n\nBenefits\n\n- You may field Pox Walkers from Codex – Renegades & Heretics as Troops choices but they gain the Support Squad special rule.\n- You may field Plague Ogryns from Codex – Renegades & Heretics as Elites choices.\n- Pox Walker units in your army gain the Deep Strike special rule.",
